      "content": {
        "json": "# 🛡️ AI Security & Operations Dashboard\n---\n### GitHub Models · Azure API Management · Content Safety · Prompt Shield\n\n<div style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #0078D4 0%, #5C2D91 100%); padding: 16px 24px; border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 8px;\">\n<span style=\"color: #fff; font-size: 14px;\">Monitorización en tiempo real de la plataforma de IA con capas de seguridad integradas.<br/>Tabla: <code style=\"background: rgba(255,255,255,0.15); padding: 2px 8px; border-radius: 4px; color: #fff;\">ApiManagementGatewayLogs</code> &nbsp;│&nbsp; API: <code style=\"background: rgba(255,255,255,0.15); padding: 2px 8px; border-radius: 4px; color: #fff;\">github-redirection</code> &nbsp;│&nbsp; Filtro: <code style=\"background: rgba(255,255,255,0.15); padding: 2px 8px; border-radius: 4px; color: #fff;\">POST</code></span>\n</div>",
